Two countries, two loves, one heart

2
00:09:39,130 --> 00:09:45,130
Brooklyn is a romance, drama, history film directed by John Crowley.

3
00:14:28,695 --> 00:14:34,695
In 1950s Ireland and New York, young Eilis Lacey has to
choose between two men and two countries.

4
