Eilis Lacey, played by Saoirse Ronan.

5
00:24:07,826 --> 00:24:13,826
Jim Farrell, played by Domhnall Gleeson.

6
00:28:57,391 --> 00:29:03,391
Tony Fiorello, played by Emory Cohen.

7
